    "updated_at": "2021-04-24T05:17:05Z",
    "body": "For the record, I'm working on defining multipart/form-data in https://github.com/andreubotella/multipart-form-data, including a parser for use in `Body.prototype.formData()` and potentially in servers. I'm trying to reach something interoperable, rather than add new stuff, but having the format solidly defined would be necessary before adding `Content-Length`.",
